  "physical_fixture_contract": [
    "All267 pages are unique static4KiB slots; QKV0/1 each96 populated pages from3planes*8localheads*16KiB. IO eight pages model complete32KiB area, ATT_OUT64 pages coverB1/S64 output region256KiB.",
    "Independent host byte transformation reconstructs both original12MiB QKV images from frozen786432-byte tensor and A5 holes; verify full12MiB and10240064-byte-prefix SHA256 against original manifest. Then copy only listed pages into simulator backing. This does not change virtual image bytes.",
    "On BEGIN, both QKV backing memories must remain allA5; after accepted ticket/epochs, at a fully quiescent command boundary the host model populates external QKV pages and publishes the corresponding receipt. Never preload internal DUT cache.",
    "QKV writes are forbidden; all writes to descriptor/io/aux forbidden. Addresses outside registeredpages fail instead of silently returning data. Scan all registeredinput/output bytes, compare exact requested256 outputbytes and all other ATT_OUT/observed sentinels. Unregistered regions are outside the materialized simulator model; do not claim a physical full8MiB memory scan.",
    "IO request starts from frozen832-byte request with explicitly bound request/generation updates and zeros elsewhere; AUX first128 bytes from frozen full package header. Descriptor160U32/640bytes; observed256U32/1024bytes, initial deadbeef words matching existingTB. Preserve full observed reserved-tail checks."
  ],
